WEBVTT

00:23:27.663 --> 00:23:32.246
so with Michael Dennis Browne, the poet
Michael Dennis Browne and my eyes,

00:23:32.246 --> 00:23:36.538
I just everything, oh, you know,
absolutely exploded. And I thought.

00:23:37.829 --> 00:23:41.413
I have to trust this, I have to you know,

00:23:41.413 --> 00:23:45.579
I thought that I could sort of funnel
my my desire to write into

00:23:45.579 --> 00:23:49.121
the channel of journalism because
it's the job, you know,

00:23:49.121 --> 00:23:52.746
that you can actually get paid to write.
But I don't want to do that.

00:23:52.746 --> 00:23:56.246
Like, I want to really put all
of my heart and my faith in

00:23:56.829 --> 00:23:59.788
and creative writing. So I switched majors
and became an English major.

00:23:59.788 --> 00:24:03.246
And what I thought I'd do with that
is become a great American writer.